te B's interpersonal issues. So she may change vote to Candidate C.\n\nLet's craft public message: \"Given we have no evidence of B's decision quality, and we do have clear evidence that C makes correct decisions quickly, I am shifting my provisional recommendation to Candidate C.\" Provide reasoning.\n\nProceed."}
